1
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,480
In a northern town

2
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,880
lives a

3
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:14,720
southern...

4
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:17,280
I really can't drink anymore.

5
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,240
You bastards.

6
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,320
Li Zhangxin,

7
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:27,000
you again?

8
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,520
He Shi,

9
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,200
you don't even deserve to be human,

10
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,840
let alone a father.

11
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:37,920
Xique!

12
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,600
Xique,

13
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:41,300
stop smashing things.

14
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,240
This kid isn't even mine.

15
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,800
Help! Go away!

16
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,240
Get away from me!

17
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,440
Help! Get out of here!

18
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,570
Didn't you call the police?

19
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:15,040
You know,

20
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,840
as the richest family in Rongcheng,

21
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:20,000
any stir in the He family

22
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,960
is like front-page entertainment news.

23
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,320
If I called the police,

24
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,530
it would only humiliate the He family.

25
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,320
Are you willing to just suffer in silence?

26
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,920
If I hadn't gotten pregnant,

27
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,120
this could have been

28
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,880
covered up.

29
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:37,440
Then how did He Shi

30
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,600
find out?

31
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,000
Honey,

32
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,240
We're having a baby.

33
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,560
Tell me, whose is it?

34
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,480
Whose else could it be but yours?

35
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,120
Bullshit!

36
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,560
I'm completely infertile.

37
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,040
Since that day,

38
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,370
He Shi seemed like a different person.

39
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,970
It's not your fault.

40
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,680
You're a victim too.

41
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,640
I didn't want to keep him at first.

42
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,210
But the doctor said my health was poor.

43
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,240
I went to the hospital for a checkup

44
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:19,200
and was caught by paparazzi.

45
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,360
Mr. He, not knowing the truth,

46
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,960
wouldn't let me abort him.

47
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:25,480
This is his only eldest grandson.

48
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,079
He Shi

49
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,760
just agreed to it like that.

50
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,240
And so,

51
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,160
we kept him.

52
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:35,410
But all the terrible things
He Shi is doing now

53
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,320
are aimed at this child.

54
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,680
Maybe

55
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:42,040
he just can't get over it.

56
00:03:44,079 --> 00:03:45,280
What's done is done.

57
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,040
What else can I do?

58
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,840
Most of the surveillance cameras
on that road

59
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,680
inexplicably broke down that day,

60
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,210
leaving only this footage.

61
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,010
Someone must have tampered with them.

62
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,240
Besides Zhang Xin,

63
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:10,080
who else wants me dead?

64
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,360
Why is Li Zhangxin here?

65
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:21,279
The family motto echoes
with profound meaning.

66
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,240
The butler is out of the way.

67
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,360
Next

68
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,560
are Zhang Xin and He Shi.

69
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:41,040
Good.

70
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,720
In the future,

71
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,280
you won't just be washing for Mrs. He...

72
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,100
You even have to wash your husband's.

73
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,240
She's pregnant,

74
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,000
so it's already hard
for her to get around.

75
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:00,840
We have so many maids at home.

76
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,440
Just let them do the washing.

77
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,440
My dear brother,

78
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,940
you're finally awake.

79
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,040
What,

80
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,300
feeling sorry for her?

81
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,960
Do you want her

82
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,400
to serve you too?

83
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,000
Since we're all part of the He family,

84
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,460
we should behave properly

85
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,960
and show the demeanor expected of us.

86
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,320
Dad isn't even here.

87
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,410
Who are you putting on this act for?

88
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,480
Mrs. He,

89
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,200
my sister-in-law didn't marry
into the He family

90
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,800
to wash your feet.

91
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,320
Did I force you?

92
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,200
Not at all.

93
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,520
I did it willingly.

94
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,320
He Yu,

95
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,080
thank you.

96
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,760
I'm fine.

97
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,080
Did you hear that?

98
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,240
Don't interrupt their fun.

99
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,920
Hopeless.

100
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,760
Come in.

101
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:38,360
Second Young Master,

102
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,680
you've been bedridden for so long.

103
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,000
Your body must be stiff.

104
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,600
Let me help you with some rehab exercises.

105
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,360
Okay.

106
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,320
What did you do before
joining the He family?

107
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,560
Going to school, of course.

108
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,720
I just graduated.

109
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,640
What were you doing

110
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,760
on July 4th?

111
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:05,000
Why are you asking about
such a specific date all of a sudden?

112
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,200
July 4th,

113
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,560
three months ago.

114
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,100
Is it the day you had the car accident?

115
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,160
Okay, okay.

116
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,290
I'll be right there.

117
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,880
A hit-and-run? Is this guy for real?

118
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:18,440
Yeah.

119
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,560
Okay, okay.

120
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,320
I got it.

121
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,960
Could it be that

122
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,480
the one hit by the car
was my second brother?

123
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,280
What's wrong?

124
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,159
Nothing.

125
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,200
Why is this hairstyle so unique?

126
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,360
Otherwise it'd be too boring.

127
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,320
Mei.

128
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,800
Ah!

129
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,840
It's nothing.

130
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,440
Why is your hair

131
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,300
different from everyone else's?

132
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:09,740
It'd be too boring otherwise.

133
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,160
Young Master,

134
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,560
you're in the wrong room.

135
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,280
Li Zhangxin,

136
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,320
isn't it time

137
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:30,240
we settled our score?

138
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,200
What score?

139
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,960
I just work for the He family

140
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,480
and they pay me, right?

141
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,559
Playing dumb with me?

142
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,960
If it weren't for you last night,

143
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:42,480
I wouldn't have embarrassed myself
in front of all those people.

144
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,080
You said those things

145
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,520
and made the mess yourself.

146
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,840
What does it have to do with me?

147
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,080
Besides,

148
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,440
didn't you ask Shu Roujing
to keep the baby

149
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,200
because

150
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,360
you were afraid Mr. He

151
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,720
would find out you're infertile

152
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,560
and cut you out of the will?

153
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,800
What are you laughing at?

154
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,360
If Mr. He finds out

155
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,480
that this grandson is a fake,

156
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,170
and that you lied to him,

157
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,660
what do you think he'll do?

158
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:18,240
I dare you to tell my dad.

159
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,840
Maybe I will.

160
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,960
Don't worry.

161
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,520
I'll kill you

162
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,760
before my dad gets back.

163
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,080
Let

164
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,200
go.

165
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,600
He Shi,

166
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,480
it's one thing to do
whatever you want outside,

167
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,880
but this is the He family.

168
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,080
How dare you hit your brother!

169
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,340
Stop fighting!

170
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,360
Stop fighting.

171
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,560
Fine, keep fighting.

172
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,680
Then I'll record this

173
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:03,600
and let everyone know

174
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,200
that the He family is at odds.

175
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,440
Are you okay?

176
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,000
Just protect yourself.

177
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,040
Honey,

178
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,300
time to wash your feet.

179
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:51,740
Why is it so hot?

180
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,440
I'm sorry.

181
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,040
I'll add some cold water.

182
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:57,160
Since you hope this child

183
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,600
will bring you benefits,

184
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,530
you shouldn't let anything happen to him.

185
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,960
You should treat
the eldest daughter-in-law well.

186
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,880
Otherwise,

187
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:07,080
Master He won't let you get away with it.

188
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,200
Wipe it clean.

189
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,120
Yes.

190
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,920
Li Zhangxin,

191
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,520
I will destroy you.

192
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,320
Come in.

193
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:23,480
Li Zhangxin,

194
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,200
gather everyone quickly.

195
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,260
The Master is back.

196
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,480
Hurry up. Move it.

197
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,360
Quick.

198
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,640
Is everything ready over there?

199
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,880
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

200
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,960
Master.

201
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,920
Welcome back, Master.

202
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:51,760
Are you tired?

203
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,360
Was the journey exhausting?

204
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,800
Dad,
